998
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:55,170
<font size="64">"I still get this cold feeling inside."</font>

999
00:24:55,170 --> 00:24:56,970
<font size="64">- She can't see a future with him. - He's decent.</font>

1000
00:24:56,970 --> 00:25:00,340
<font size="64">"Should I stay with such a pathetic guy?"</font>

1001
00:25:00,770 --> 00:25:02,870
<font size="64">- There you have it. - Isn't he a decent guy?</font>

1002
00:25:01,610 --> 00:25:06,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A: Break up, B: Don't break up)</font>

1003
00:25:02,870 --> 00:25:05,340
<font size="64">- You must be like him. - I'm not.</font>

1004
00:25:05,340 --> 00:25:06,510
<font size="64">I'll definitely pass.</font>

1005
00:25:06,510 --> 00:25:08,450
<font size="64">If I'm being honest,</font>

1006
00:25:06,810 --> 00:25:09,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The discussion begins.)</font>

1007
00:25:08,680 --> 00:25:11,680
<font size="64">we can't really judge...</font>

1008
00:25:11,680 --> 00:25:12,980
<font size="64">their relationship...</font>

1009
00:25:12,980 --> 00:25:15,490
<font size="64">based on just a handful of examples.</font>

1010
00:25:15,490 --> 00:25:18,760
<font size="64">Still, we have to pick A or B based on what we just heard.</font>

1011
00:25:16,090 --> 00:25:19,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They'll judge solely based on the story.)</font>

1012
00:25:18,760 --> 00:25:22,330
<font size="64">Right. Here's the first thing we need to focus on.</font>

1013
00:25:22,330 --> 00:25:24,330
<font size="64">This guy is pretty good to his girlfriend,</font>

1014
00:25:24,330 --> 00:25:26,330
<font size="64">but we're taking that for granted.</font>

1015
00:25:26,530 --> 00:25:28,700
<font size="64">We should see that as a plus on his part.</font>

1016
00:25:27,230 --> 00:25:29,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(B: Don't break up)</font>

1017
00:25:28,700 --> 00:25:30,270
<font size="64">- Nice. - Aren't I right?</font>

1018
00:25:29,570 --> 00:25:32,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(You shouldn't take his romantic side for granted.)</font>

1019
00:25:30,270 --> 00:25:31,870
<font size="64">Everyone's taking that for granted.</font>

1020
00:25:31,870 --> 00:25:34,770
<font size="64">Jong Kook, the girlfriend who sent in...</font>

1021
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Objection)</font>

1022
00:25:34,770 --> 00:25:36,070
<font size="64">- the story... - Yes?</font>

1023
00:25:36,070 --> 00:25:38,980
<font size="64">never said she expected his devotion as the bare minimum.</font>

1024
00:25:36,570 --> 00:25:40,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(No overanalyzing)</font>

1025
00:25:38,980 --> 00:25:41,680
<font size="64">I know. I'm just saying, not many guys would go out...</font>

1026
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:44,210
<font size="64">and buy you medicine just because you coughed a little.</font>

1027
00:25:44,210 --> 00:25:47,850
<font size="64">That's all part of his calculating nature.</font>

1028
00:25:47,850 --> 00:25:49,390
<font size="64">- It's pretty rare. - It's his calculating nature.</font>

1029
00:25:48,520 --> 00:25:50,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Thinking)</font>

1030
00:25:49,620 --> 00:25:51,220
<font size="64">- Yes, he's calculating. - Hold on.</font>

1031
00:25:51,250 --> 00:25:53,720
<font size="64">- Hyun Young. What do you think? - Yes?</font>

1032
00:25:53,720 --> 00:25:55,930
<font size="64">I asked, and she already can't stand the guy.</font>

1033
00:25:56,760 --> 00:25:58,660
<font size="64">Hyun Young, you must not mind a guy like that.</font>

1034
00:25:58,800 --> 00:26:00,560
<font size="64">No way. He's a walking red flag.</font>

1035
00:26:01,060 --> 00:26:02,530
<font size="64">- It's pretty rare. - A total red flag.</font>

1036
00:26:01,870 --> 00:26:03,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Dead serious)</font>

1037
00:26:03,630 --> 00:26:06,240
<font size="64">Of course he's a red flag.</font>

1038
00:26:03,800 --> 00:26:06,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hyun Young doesn't like people who are calculating.)</font>

1039
00:26:06,240 --> 00:26:08,570
<font size="64">Still, if I were his girlfriend,</font>

1040
00:26:08,570 --> 00:26:11,140
<font size="64">I'd at least give him a shot.</font>

1041
00:26:11,140 --> 00:26:13,440
<font size="64">- He apologized in tears. - Exactly.</font>

1042
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:14,440
<font size="64">He's sincere as well.</font>

1043
00:26:14,440 --> 00:26:16,780
<font size="64">- Yes, in tears. - I'd give him this chance...</font>

1044
00:26:16,780 --> 00:26:18,720
<font size="64">to realize he shouldn't be...</font>

1045
00:26:17,010 --> 00:26:19,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Feeling bad)</font>

1046
00:26:18,720 --> 00:26:22,090
<font size="64">so calculating when it comes to his girlfriend.</font>

1047
00:26:20,380 --> 00:26:22,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(B: Don't break up)</font>

1048
00:26:22,090 --> 00:26:23,420
<font size="64">I'd want him to learn that lesson...</font>

1049
00:26:22,820 --> 00:26:25,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Give him a chance to work on himself.)</font>

1050
00:26:23,420 --> 00:26:26,420
<font size="64">- Yes. - for himself.</font>

1051
00:26:26,420 --> 00:26:29,890
<font size="64">Hyun Young, you should let go of feelings like that.</font>

1052
00:26:29,890 --> 00:26:32,060
<font size="64">- But life is long. - I know, but...</font>

1053
00:26:32,060 --> 00:26:33,500
<font size="64">- Not for Seok Jin. - He doesn't have much time left.</font>

1054
00:26:33,500 --> 00:26:34,900
<font size="64">For Seok Jin, life isn't quite as long anymore.</font>

1055
00:26:34,900 --> 00:26:36,500
<font size="64">- He doesn't have much time left. - His isn't as long as yours.</font>

1056
00:26:36,500 --> 00:26:37,970
<font size="64">- He doesn't have many years left. - How can you be so cruel?</font>

1057
00:26:37,970 --> 00:26:39,240
<font size="64">His isn't as long as yours.</font>

1058
00:26:39,240 --> 00:26:40,600
<font size="64">- He's in a hurry. - Don't generalize.</font>

1059
00:26:39,340 --> 00:26:42,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The length of life is relative.)</font>

1060
00:26:40,600 --> 00:26:41,770
<font size="64">His isn't as long as yours.</font>

1061
00:26:41,770 --> 00:26:43,370
<font size="64">- The afterlife is after him. - I know.</font>

1062
00:26:43,370 --> 00:26:45,580
<font size="64">- But Seok Jin... - He's just not willing to go yet.</font>

1063
00:26:45,010 --> 00:26:47,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Correcting herself)</font>

1064
00:26:45,580 --> 00:26:47,080
<font size="64">- might not give him another chance, - Yes.</font>

1065
00:26:47,080 --> 00:26:50,050
<font size="64">but I have more years left to live than Seok Jin.</font>

1066
00:26:47,980 --> 00:26:50,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(B: Don't break up)</font>

1067
00:26:50,050 --> 00:26:52,280
<font size="64">- I'm willing to give him a chance. - Ki Young.</font>

1068
00:26:50,250 --> 00:26:52,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(My life is longer. I'd give him another chance.)</font>

1069
00:26:52,280 --> 00:26:53,850
<font size="64">Ki Young, what's your take on this?</font>

1070
00:26:53,220 --> 00:26:55,290
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What does Ki Young think?)</font>

1071
00:26:54,480 --> 00:26:56,450
<font size="64">Looking at it realistically,</font>

1072
00:26:56,590 --> 00:26:59,960
<font size="64">I'm a strong believer that people never change their ways.</font>

1073
00:26:57,590 --> 00:27:01,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A: Break up. People don't change easily.)</font>

1074
00:26:59,960 --> 00:27:01,420
<font size="64">- That's true. - Of course.</font>

1075
00:27:01,420 --> 00:27:03,960
<font size="64">Let's just say you married someone like that.</font>

1076
00:27:03,960 --> 00:27:07,360
<font size="64">I think he's only being this calculating...</font>

1077
00:27:06,530 --> 00:27:08,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(B: Don't break up. He's only calculating when they're dating.)</font>

1078
00:27:07,360 --> 00:27:09,800
<font size="64">because they're still in the dating phase.</font>

1079
00:27:08,670 --> 00:27:10,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He'll change once they're married.)</font>

1080
00:27:09,800 --> 00:27:11,430
<font size="64">- No way. After marriage... - When they become family...</font>

1081
00:27:11,430 --> 00:27:13,170
<font size="64">People like him get worse after marriage.</font>

1082
00:27:13,170 --> 00:27:14,470
<font size="64">After marriage? Wait, hold on.</font>

1083
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:15,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Tapping)</font>

1084
00:27:14,470 --> 00:27:15,610
<font size="64">- He'll get worse. - After marriage...</font>

1085
00:27:15,610 --> 00:27:16,610
<font size="64">Can you not hit me like this?</font>

1086
00:27:16,610 --> 00:27:17,710
<font size="64">Wait, hear me out.</font>

1087
00:27:17,710 --> 00:27:19,240
<font size="64">- Why do you keep tapping me? - Just...</font>

1088
00:27:20,140 --> 00:27:21,880
<font size="64">- Sir, hear me out. - I see it...</font>

1089
00:27:20,510 --> 00:27:23,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Bickering)</font>

1090
00:27:21,880 --> 00:27:23,480
<font size="64">- a little differently. - Sir.</font>

1091
00:27:23,480 --> 00:27:26,480
<font size="64">Once you get married, everything becomes shared.</font>

1092
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:28,350
<font size="64">- Not for him. - He could keep things separated.</font>

1093
00:27:27,020 --> 00:27:29,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Not you)</font>

1094
00:27:28,350 --> 00:27:29,790
<font size="64">- He's capable of that. - No way.</font>

1095
00:27:29,790 --> 00:27:31,050
<font size="64">- Jong Kook's right. - That...</font>

1096
00:27:29,950 --> 00:27:32,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Taking Jong Kook's side)</font>

1097
00:27:31,050 --> 00:27:32,420
<font size="64">- You combine your finances. - That's not it.</font>

1098
00:27:32,420 --> 00:27:34,960
<font size="64">Regardless of what he thinks, the money is still shared.</font>

1099
00:27:33,060 --> 00:27:34,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(B: Don't break up.)</font>

1100
00:27:34,720 --> 00:27:36,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Once you're married, there's no yours or mine.)</font>

1101
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:36,430
<font size="64">He'll be even worse.</font>

1102
00:27:36,430 --> 00:27:38,160
<font size="64">Let's hear from Ye Eun, the bride-to-be.</font>

1103
00:27:36,730 --> 00:27:39,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What does Ddochi, the bride-to-be, think?)</font>

1104
00:27:38,160 --> 00:27:40,900
<font size="64">When you get married, you share all your money.</font>

1105
00:27:40,900 --> 00:27:42,700
<font size="64">- You combine your finances. - That's right.</font>

1106
00:27:42,700 --> 00:27:45,470
<font size="64">But whoever contributes a little more expects credit for it.</font>

1107
00:27:45,470 --> 00:27:47,670
<font size="64">- Is that the case with you? - Who expects credit for it?</font>

1108
00:27:47,670 --> 00:27:49,240
<font size="64">- What? - Is that how it is with you?</font>

1109
00:27:49,240 --> 00:27:50,770
<font size="64">- What? - Does someone expect credit for it?</font>

1110
00:27:50,770 --> 00:27:52,280
<font size="64">- Why would you expect credit? - It's only natural?</font>

1111
00:27:51,270 --> 00:27:54,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The trap has been set.)</font>

1112
00:27:52,280 --> 00:27:54,080
<font size="64">- Is that a given? - I mean...</font>

1113
00:27:54,080 --> 00:27:56,250
<font size="64">Whoever contributes more naturally gets more of a say.</font>

1114
00:27:54,380 --> 00:27:57,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Assisting)</font>

1115
00:27:56,250 --> 00:27:58,310
<font size="64">Exactly, you get more of a say.</font>

1116
00:27:58,310 --> 00:28:00,380
<font size="64">- Why would you expect credit? - But once you're married,</font>

1117
00:27:58,550 --> 00:28:00,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Annoying)</font>

1118
00:28:00,380 --> 00:28:03,090
<font size="64">even though you're sharing all your money,</font>

1119
00:28:01,520 --> 00:28:03,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A: Break up)</font>

1120
00:28:03,090 --> 00:28:05,290
<font size="64">- people actually get... - He'd still be calculating.</font>

1121
00:28:03,550 --> 00:28:06,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(People are naturally calculating, married or not.)</font>

1122
00:28:05,290 --> 00:28:06,360
<font size="64">more calculating.</font>

1123
00:28:06,360 --> 00:28:08,890
<font size="64">No way. How's that love?</font>

1124
00:28:08,960 --> 00:28:10,330
<font size="64">I have a warm heart.</font>

1125
00:28:10,330 --> 00:28:13,230
<font size="64">Hold on. Just hear me out.</font>

1126
00:28:13,260 --> 00:28:15,230
<font size="64">Once you're married,</font>

1127
00:28:15,230 --> 00:28:17,530
<font size="64">you only get calculating if you're already thinking about divorce.</font>

1128
00:28:17,530 --> 00:28:19,470
<font size="64">That makes sense...</font>

1129
00:28:19,370 --> 00:28:21,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Too immersed)</font>

1130
00:28:19,470 --> 00:28:21,370
<font size="64">if you're planning for a divorce in advance.</font>

1131
00:28:21,370 --> 00:28:22,610
<font size="64">Jong Kook's having a field day.</font>

1132
00:28:22,670 --> 00:28:24,170
<font size="64">Is this Jong Kook's problem?</font>

1133
00:28:24,710 --> 00:28:26,080
<font size="64">Why are you getting worked up over this?</font>

1134
00:28:26,080 --> 00:28:27,410
<font size="64">- Why are you so angry? - It's just...</font>

1135
00:28:27,410 --> 00:28:30,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's upset that people don't understand what pure love is.)</font>

1136
00:28:27,410 --> 00:28:28,850
<font size="64">If you're not thinking about divorce...</font>

1137
00:28:28,850 --> 00:28:30,510
<font size="64">Why is he so worked up?</font>

1138
00:28:30,510 --> 00:28:32,680
<font size="64">- Jong Kook's having a field day. - Why is he so worked up?</font>

1139
00:28:30,980 --> 00:28:33,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's in his element.)</font>

1140
00:28:32,680 --> 00:28:33,820
<font size="64">I'm right, aren't I?</font>

1141
00:28:33,520 --> 00:28:36,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's strongly against breaking up.)</font>

1142
00:28:33,820 --> 00:28:35,520
<font size="64">- If divorce isn't on your mind... - Look at him stand up for the guy.</font>

1143
00:28:35,520 --> 00:28:36,690
<font size="64">So it's like this.</font>

1144
00:28:36,690 --> 00:28:39,690
<font size="64">Money got really tight after he bought the wallet.</font>

1145
00:28:37,590 --> 00:28:40,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(After giving her a purse as a gift)</font>

1146
00:28:39,690 --> 00:28:41,060
<font size="64">If he had told her that...</font>

1147
00:28:41,060 --> 00:28:44,530
<font size="64">She wouldn't have been offended if he had been honest.</font>

1148
00:28:44,530 --> 00:28:47,100
<font size="64">- You punk, what about his pride? - Who comments about a gift?</font>

1149
00:28:47,100 --> 00:28:49,170
<font size="64">- Did you just call me punk? - A man's pride is on the line.</font>

1150
00:28:49,630 --> 00:28:50,970
<font size="64">- Punk? - What?</font>

1151
00:28:50,970 --> 00:28:52,340
<font size="64">- You punk! - What, you punk?</font>

1152
00:28:51,070 --> 00:28:54,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The kiwi is suddenly mad.)</font>

1153
00:28:52,470 --> 00:28:54,470
<font size="64">- You punk? - Exactly, you punk.</font>

1154
00:28:54,470 --> 00:28:55,570
<font size="64">Jin Kyeong, sit back down.</font>

1155
00:28:55,770 --> 00:28:57,340
<font size="64">- How old are you? - How old am I?</font>

1156
00:28:57,340 --> 00:29:01,010
<font size="64">I'm 40 and... Well, I'm on the older side.</font>

1157
00:29:00,340 --> 00:29:02,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He was loud throughout the discussion,)</font>

1158
00:29:01,340 --> 00:29:02,710
<font size="64">Why didn't you tell him your age?</font>

1159
00:29:02,050 --> 00:29:03,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(but went quiet when age came up.)</font>

1160
00:29:02,710 --> 00:29:04,610
<font size="64">- Exactly. - Why didn't you tell him your age?</font>

1161
00:29:03,710 --> 00:29:06,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Kim Thug gets humbled by his age.)</font>

1162
00:29:04,610 --> 00:29:05,780
<font size="64">I'm on the older side.</font>

1163
00:29:05,780 --> 00:29:07,950
<font size="64">Which subway line are you on? Isn't it Line Five?</font>

1164
00:29:07,950 --> 00:29:08,950
<font size="64">Yes, it is.</font>

1165
00:29:08,950 --> 00:29:11,250
<font size="64">It's a bit harsh to ask his age like that.</font>

1166
00:29:09,750 --> 00:29:13,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Line 5?)</font>

1167
00:29:11,250 --> 00:29:12,320
<font size="64">- Line Five. - Which subway line?</font>

1168
00:29:12,320 --> 00:29:13,460
<font size="64">Which subway line are you on?</font>

1169
00:29:13,460 --> 00:29:14,860
<font size="64">I'd rather not say.</font>

1170
00:29:15,290 --> 00:29:16,460
<font size="64">You're on Line Six.</font>

1171
00:29:16,460 --> 00:29:19,400
<font size="64">Maybe I'm taking this a bit too far, but...</font>

1172
00:29:19,400 --> 00:29:21,330
<font size="64">- Then don't say it. - Wait.</font>

1173
00:29:21,700 --> 00:29:23,070
<font size="64">- This guy... - If that's what you think...</font>

1174
00:29:23,070 --> 00:29:24,700
<font size="64">Maybe I'm taking this a bit too far, but I'll still say it.</font>

1175
00:29:23,100 --> 00:29:24,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Persistent)</font>

1176
00:29:24,700 --> 00:29:25,870
<font size="64">I doubt he did this,</font>

1177
00:29:26,540 --> 00:29:28,370
<font size="64">though what if he gave her a fake while making her pay as much...</font>

1178
00:29:28,370 --> 00:29:29,810
<font size="64">- as the real thing costs? - Come on!</font>

1179
00:29:29,810 --> 00:29:32,210
<font size="64">- He wouldn't. - He'd never do that.</font>

1180
00:29:30,210 --> 00:29:32,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(You went too far!)</font>

1181
00:29:32,210 --> 00:29:34,080
<font size="64">- That could happen. - Where does the doubt end?</font>

1182
00:29:32,780 --> 00:29:36,750
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(His comment leaves them wondering what's going on in his head.)</font>

1183
00:29:34,080 --> 00:29:35,410
<font size="64">- He could do that. - You never know.</font>

1184
00:29:35,410 --> 00:29:36,850
<font size="64">- It doesn't make sense, but still. - I mean,</font>

1185
00:29:36,850 --> 00:29:39,780
<font size="64">he made her split the cost of parking.</font>

1186
00:29:37,480 --> 00:29:40,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok, who chose A, speaks up again.)</font>

1187
00:29:39,780 --> 00:29:42,320
<font size="64">- That's too much. - That's something...</font>

1188
00:29:40,680 --> 00:29:42,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A: Break up)</font>

1189
00:29:42,620 --> 00:29:43,990
<font size="64">I find hard to understand.</font>

1190
00:29:42,650 --> 00:29:44,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(I don't get splitting even the parking fee.)</font>

1191
00:29:43,990 --> 00:29:46,420
<font size="64">A birthday gift should come from the heart,</font>

1192
00:29:45,420 --> 00:29:47,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A: Break up)</font>

1193
00:29:46,420 --> 00:29:49,460
<font size="64">but he was focused on the price and wanted to get...</font>

1194
00:29:47,390 --> 00:29:50,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The problem is that he put a price on a heartfelt gift.)</font>

1195
00:29:49,460 --> 00:29:51,090
<font size="64">- his money's worth. - Hear me out.</font>

1196
00:29:51,090 --> 00:29:53,200
<font size="64">- He obviously loves her. - Sure.</font>

1197
00:29:51,330 --> 00:29:53,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Refuting)</font>

1198
00:29:53,200 --> 00:29:55,170
<font size="64">- He's not that well off, - Exactly.</font>

1199
00:29:55,170 --> 00:29:57,170
<font size="64">- but he wanted to get her a gift. - He wanted to get her something.</font>

1200
00:29:57,170 --> 00:29:58,470
<font size="64">He went out of his way...</font>

1201
00:29:58,470 --> 00:30:00,470
<font size="64">to buy something he really couldn't afford.</font>

1202
00:30:00,770 --> 00:30:04,340
<font size="64">Hearing it from you makes it way more real. Seriously.</font>

1203
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:04,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Touched)</font>

1204
00:30:04,340 --> 00:30:07,840
<font size="64">It's the same with the parking fee. He knows that she's exhausted...</font>

1205
00:30:05,580 --> 00:30:08,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The story of a poor romantic)</font>

1206
00:30:07,840 --> 00:30:11,080
<font size="64">and wants to do right by her even though he's not well off.</font>

1207
00:30:11,080 --> 00:30:13,780
<font size="64">- That's why he went ahead... - Exactly.</font>

1208
00:30:13,780 --> 00:30:16,250
<font size="64">and drove her around anyway.</font>

1209
00:30:16,020 --> 00:30:18,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Feeling bad)</font>

1210
00:30:16,250 --> 00:30:18,250
<font size="64">"Hey, you're here. Just get some sleep, then."</font>

1211
00:30:18,690 --> 00:30:21,320
<font size="64">"Hey, you're here. Just get some sleep, then."</font>

1212
00:30:21,320 --> 00:30:22,790
<font size="64">- Just looking at your face... - I feel terrible.</font>

1213
00:30:21,720 --> 00:30:24,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Teary-eyed)</font>

1214
00:30:22,790 --> 00:30:23,860
<font size="64">makes me feel sorry for you.</font>

1215
00:30:23,860 --> 00:30:25,530
<font size="64">- I feel bad for you. - Do you have 50 cents?</font>

1216
00:30:25,530 --> 00:30:26,560
<font size="64">Okay, I'll go park.</font>

1217
00:30:26,560 --> 00:30:28,330
<font size="64">Head inside, then. Okay, bye.</font>

1218
00:30:28,430 --> 00:30:30,230
<font size="64">- How sweet is that? - He's so sweet!</font>

1219
00:30:28,670 --> 00:30:32,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pleading)</font>

1220
00:30:30,230 --> 00:30:31,970
<font size="64">- You'd break up with him? - Exactly.</font>

1221
00:30:31,970 --> 00:30:34,040
<font size="64">- Is this your personal story? - You're right.</font>

1222
00:30:32,170 --> 00:30:35,870
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Clapping)</font>

1223
00:30:34,040 --> 00:30:36,440
<font size="64">You look way too into this. Are you speaking from experience?</font>

1224
00:30:36,440 --> 00:30:38,510
<font size="64">- I am speaking from experience. - Yes, exactly.</font>

1225
00:30:38,510 --> 00:30:40,880
<font size="64">- He has nothing else to give her. - It's love.</font>

1226
00:30:39,210 --> 00:30:42,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(No wonder his acting felt so real.)</font>

1227
00:30:41,340 --> 00:30:44,350
<font size="64">- I mean... - I want the boyfriend...</font>

1228
00:30:44,350 --> 00:30:46,450
<font size="64">- to be more honest with her. - I see.</font>

1229
00:30:46,450 --> 00:30:48,380
<font size="64">- That's it. - My situation isn't ideal,</font>

1230
00:30:48,380 --> 00:30:50,290
<font size="64">- Yes, that's better. - so I'd appreciate the help.</font>

1231
00:30:50,420 --> 00:30:51,750
<font size="64">I'll save up more and...</font>

1232
00:30:51,750 --> 00:30:53,460
<font size="64">- Let's give him this advice. - Right.</font>

1233
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:54,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It stays with her.)</font>

1234
00:30:54,060 --> 00:30:55,960
<font size="64">Still, he got on his knees and cried.</font>

1235
00:30:55,960 --> 00:30:58,060
<font size="64">- His heart is in the right place. - I agree.</font>

1236
00:30:56,490 --> 00:30:58,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(B: Don't break up)</font>

1237
00:30:58,260 --> 00:31:00,900
<font size="64">- He deserves another chance. - This...</font>

1238
00:30:58,560 --> 00:31:01,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He seems sincere. Give him a chance to change.)</font>

1239
00:31:00,900 --> 00:31:02,700
<font size="64">Didn't you say people rarely change?</font>

1240
00:31:02,700 --> 00:31:05,100
<font size="64">That's true, but it hits a little too close to home.</font>

1241
00:31:05,100 --> 00:31:06,970
<font size="64">- That was me a long time ago. - Really?</font>

1242
00:31:06,970 --> 00:31:09,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(His passionate performance changed Ki Young's mind.)</font>

1243
00:31:06,970 --> 00:31:07,970
<font size="64">We can all relate.</font>

1244
00:31:07,970 --> 00:31:09,440
<font size="64">We understand why he did what he did.</font>

1245
00:31:09,440 --> 00:31:12,080
<font size="64">- Of course. - Money can't get you that.</font>

1246
00:31:09,470 --> 00:31:12,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(One of the staff members is nodding as well.)</font>

1247
00:31:12,080 --> 00:31:14,980
<font size="64">Here's my issue with the whole situation.</font>

1248
00:31:12,910 --> 00:31:15,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Break Up's final argument)</font>

1249
00:31:14,980 --> 00:31:17,680
<font size="64">Somewhere along the line,</font>

1250
00:31:17,680 --> 00:31:19,380
<font size="64">she'll start worrying that kindness isn't just kindness...</font>

1251
00:31:19,380 --> 00:31:20,980
<font size="64">and love isn't just love.</font>

1252
00:31:20,980 --> 00:31:23,350
<font size="64">That without knowing it,</font>

1253
00:31:23,350 --> 00:31:25,260
<font size="64">- she'll think she'll be billed... - That's right.</font>

1254
00:31:23,690 --> 00:31:25,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A: Break up. Everything you thought was an act of love...)</font>

1255
00:31:25,260 --> 00:31:27,490
<font size="64">for that affection down the road.</font>

1256
00:31:25,720 --> 00:31:27,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(might come with a price tag.)</font>

1257
00:31:27,490 --> 00:31:29,260
<font size="64">She's already doubting him.</font>

1258
00:31:29,260 --> 00:31:30,560
<font size="64">- Yes, there's doubt. - The girlfriend said it herself.</font>

1259
00:31:30,690 --> 00:31:32,160
<font size="64">Why else would she have written to us about it?</font>

1260
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:34,700
<font size="64">- Exactly. How sad is that? - She'll find herself...</font>

1261
00:31:34,200 --> 00:31:36,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Indecisive)</font>

1262
00:31:34,700 --> 00:31:36,700
<font size="64">replaying it in her mind nonstop.</font>

1263
00:31:36,870 --> 00:31:38,870
<font size="64">- That'll take a toll on anyone. - Exactly.</font>

1264
00:31:37,130 --> 00:31:39,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Convinced)</font>

1265
00:31:38,870 --> 00:31:41,700
<font size="64">You'll worry about money in every situation.</font>

1266
00:31:39,600 --> 00:31:42,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Thinking hard)</font>

1267
00:31:41,700 --> 00:31:42,710
<font size="64">- They should break up. - Things will get complicated.</font>

1268
00:31:42,710 --> 00:31:44,470
<font size="64">- Please choose a side. - The laid-back type is better.</font>

1269
00:31:42,970 --> 00:31:46,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They should choose a side now.)</font>

1270
00:31:44,470 --> 00:31:46,510
<font size="64">- We'll see what you chose first. - The laid-back type.</font>

1271
00:31:46,440 --> 00:31:49,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A: Break up, B: Don't break up)</font>

1272
00:31:46,510 --> 00:31:48,040
<font size="64">One, two, three.</font>

1273
00:31:48,140 --> 00:31:49,180
<font size="64">- A is the way to go. - They should break up.</font>

1274
00:31:49,180 --> 00:31:50,810
<font size="64">- Did anyone choose B? - They should break up.</font>

1275
00:31:50,850 --> 00:31:52,420
<font size="64">- They should stay together? - You want them to stay together?</font>

1276
00:31:51,680 --> 00:31:54,080
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Only Se Chan and Ki Young chose B.)</font>

1277
00:31:52,420 --> 00:31:53,980
<font size="64">- They should break up. - Right.</font>

1278
00:31:53,980 --> 00:31:55,620
<font size="64">- What's with him? - Hold on.</font>

1279
00:31:55,620 --> 00:31:57,490
<font size="64">- What's with him? - Jong Kook.</font>

1280
00:31:58,050 --> 00:32:00,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jong Kook switched to A.)</font>

1281
00:31:58,150 --> 00:31:59,890
<font size="64">- What on earth? - What?</font>

1282
00:31:59,890 --> 00:32:00,890
<font size="64">Are you kidding me?</font>

1283
00:32:01,160 --> 00:32:02,690
<font size="64">- He'll get worse. - After marriage...</font>

1284
00:32:01,360 --> 00:32:04,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He ended up getting physical while trying to defend B.)</font>

1285
00:32:02,690 --> 00:32:04,690
<font size="64">Can you not hit me like this?</font>

1286
00:32:04,690 --> 00:32:06,600
<font size="64">This guy is pretty good to his girlfriend,</font>

1287
00:32:04,930 --> 00:32:08,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pure-hearted Kim Dolsoe was completely against breaking up.)</font>

1288
00:32:06,600 --> 00:32:08,460
<font size="64">but we're taking that for granted.</font>

1289
00:32:08,460 --> 00:32:09,500
<font size="64">- Hold on. - What?</font>

1290
00:32:08,600 --> 00:32:11,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(But then he agrees with them breaking up.)</font>

1291
00:32:09,500 --> 00:32:10,530
<font size="64">What on earth?</font>

1292
00:32:10,530 --> 00:32:13,340
<font size="64">I've always thought it was right for them to break up.</font>

1293
00:32:13,340 --> 00:32:14,840
<font size="64">- Really? - Hold on.</font>

1294
00:32:14,840 --> 00:32:16,570
<font size="64">- What? - What on earth?</font>

1295
00:32:14,970 --> 00:32:17,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Speechless)</font>

1296
00:32:16,570 --> 00:32:18,940
<font size="64">- He... - After defending him like that?</font>

1297
00:32:18,940 --> 00:32:21,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If you were going to do this)</font>

1298
00:32:18,940 --> 00:32:20,080
<font size="64">Why did you hit my chest then?</font>

1299
00:32:20,080 --> 00:32:22,480
<font size="64">I just wanted to speak on his behalf.</font>

1300
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:23,980
<font size="64">- I get that. - That's it.</font>

1301
00:32:23,980 --> 00:32:26,080
<font size="64">- I get his situation. - Of course.</font>

1302
00:32:24,080 --> 00:32:26,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He was just speaking on his behalf.)</font>

1303
00:32:26,080 --> 00:32:28,890
<font size="64">Putting this out there publicly for advice?</font>

1304
00:32:28,890 --> 00:32:30,890
<font size="64">- Breaking up is the only option. - Exactly.</font>

1305
00:32:30,890 --> 00:32:31,990
<font size="64">- I mean... - She wrote to us.</font>

1306
00:32:31,450 --> 00:32:34,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Except for the two, everyone chose A.)</font>

1307
00:32:31,990 --> 00:32:33,590
<font size="64">She doesn't love him as much.</font>

1308
00:32:33,590 --> 00:32:35,890
<font size="64">The staff will vote next.</font>

1309
00:32:35,890 --> 00:32:37,690
<font size="64">Lift up your answer on the count of three.</font>

1310
00:32:37,690 --> 00:32:39,400
<font size="64">He obviously loves her.</font>

1311
00:32:38,160 --> 00:32:42,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If more of the staff choose B, the two of them win.)</font>

1312
00:32:39,500 --> 00:32:41,960
<font size="64">It takes more than just love, you punk.</font>

1313
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:43,600
<font size="64">They're already holding up A.</font>

1314
00:32:43,600 --> 00:32:44,970
<font size="64">I don't have one that says B.</font>

1315
00:32:44,970 --> 00:32:46,300
<font size="64">I wasn't that well off either.</font>

1316
00:32:45,370 --> 00:32:48,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Switch to B.)</font>

1317
00:32:46,300 --> 00:32:47,800
<font size="64">- I was broke too. - Same here.</font>

1318
00:32:48,070 --> 00:32:49,710
<font size="64">Money is the only thing he doesn't have, right?</font>

1319
00:32:49,970 --> 00:32:51,940
<font size="64">If he had the money, he'd pay. Don't you agree?</font>

1320
00:32:51,810 --> 00:32:53,740
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Nodding)</font>

1321
00:32:54,140 --> 00:32:57,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will they make unexpected choices?)</font>

1322
00:32:54,180 --> 00:32:57,610
<font size="64">We'll see what they chose. In 1, 2, 3.</font>

1323
00:32:57,610 --> 00:32:58,850
<font size="64">- Of course it's A. - What?</font>

1324
00:32:58,850 --> 00:33:00,980
<font size="64">- Of course it's A. - Most of them chose A.</font>

1325
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:02,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Most of them chose A.)</font>

1326
00:33:00,980 --> 00:33:02,490
<font size="64">- Hold on. - A!</font>

1327
00:33:02,450 --> 00:33:04,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(I told you to switch.)</font>

1328
00:33:02,490 --> 00:33:04,090
<font size="64">- Of course. - A wins by a landslide.</font>

1329
00:33:04,090 --> 00:33:05,390
<font size="64">We don't even have to count.</font>

1330
00:33:05,390 --> 00:33:07,790
<font size="64">- A is the only option. - After voting, A comes out on top.</font>

1331
00:33:06,660 --> 00:33:10,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A: "Break up" wins.)</font>

1332
00:33:08,860 --> 00:33:10,960
<font size="64">- A is the only answer. - That's the only choice.</font>

1333
00:33:11,090 --> 00:33:13,960
<font size="64">- Jong Kook, seriously? - A is the only answer.</font>

1334
00:33:11,190 --> 00:33:13,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Feeling betrayed)</font>

1335
00:33:13,960 --> 00:33:16,530
<font size="64">A is the only answer. I knew that was going to win.</font>

1336
00:33:14,260 --> 00:33:17,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Shameless)</font>

1337
00:33:16,530 --> 00:33:19,200
<font size="64">Ki Young, Se Chan, you get five coins each.</font>

1338
00:33:19,200 --> 00:33:20,270
<font size="64">Nice.</font>

1339
00:33:20,340 --> 00:33:22,170
<font size="64">- Here's the next debate. - Sure.</font>

1340
00:33:20,400 --> 00:33:22,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The second story is revealed.)</font>

1341
00:33:22,170 --> 00:33:24,470
<font size="64">Hyun Young will read it for us.</font>

1342
00:33:22,970 --> 00:33:26,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(DJ Jjoo will read the story this time.)</font>

1343
00:33:24,470 --> 00:33:27,080
<font size="64">- Got it. - Hyun Young, go ahead.</font>

1344
00:33:27,480 --> 00:33:30,880
<font size="64">A Chilling Warning From My Future Brother-in-Law, the Shaman.</font>

1345
00:33:30,880 --> 00:33:32,380
<font size="64">- What? - Oh, dear.</font>

1346
00:33:31,680 --> 00:33:34,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Spooked already)</font>

1347
00:33:32,480 --> 00:33:33,480
<font size="64">- What? - Oh, dear.</font>

1348
00:33:33,480 --> 00:33:34,480
<font size="64">A shaman?</font>

1349
00:33:34,480 --> 00:33:38,150
<font size="64">"Hello, I'm a bride-to-be about to get married..."</font>

1350
00:33:38,150 --> 00:33:40,620
<font size="64">"after three years of being madly in love."</font>

1351
00:33:41,060 --> 00:33:43,190
<font size="64">"Just recently, I met my future in-laws..."</font>

1352
00:33:43,190 --> 00:33:44,830
<font size="64">"for the very first time."</font>

1353
00:33:44,890 --> 00:33:48,630
<font size="64">"They were so kind and welcoming that it was easy to tell..."</font>

1354
00:33:48,630 --> 00:33:49,930
<font size="64">- "where my boyfriend's gentle..." - How nice.</font>

1355
00:33:49,930 --> 00:33:51,200
<font size="64">"and earnest personality came from."</font>

1356
00:33:51,270 --> 00:33:52,570
<font size="64">- Right. - "The only issue was..."</font>

1357
00:33:52,970 --> 00:33:55,100
<font size="64">- "my fiance's younger brother." - Why?</font>

1358
00:33:55,170 --> 00:33:57,670
<font size="64">"Throughout our relationship,"</font>

1359
00:33:57,670 --> 00:33:59,210
<font size="64">"my boyfriend had only mentioned..."</font>

1360
00:33:59,210 --> 00:34:00,780
<font size="64">"that his younger brother was in poor health,"</font>

1361
00:34:00,780 --> 00:34:02,880
<font size="64">"and I had never met him in person."</font>

1362
00:34:02,980 --> 00:34:04,980
<font size="64">"When I finally met him,"</font>

1363
00:34:04,980 --> 00:34:07,120
<font size="64">"something just felt unsettling."</font>

1364
00:34:07,680 --> 00:34:10,150
<font size="64">- "He kept staring at me," - That's scary.</font>

1365
00:34:10,190 --> 00:34:11,420
<font size="64">"but it felt like he was looking..."</font>

1366
00:34:11,420 --> 00:34:13,420
<font size="64">"at something other than my eyes."</font>

1367
00:34:13,620 --> 00:34:15,220
<font size="64">"It turned out that my brother-in-law..."</font>

1368
00:34:15,360 --> 00:34:18,230
<font size="64">"needed to undergo a shamanic initiation."</font>

1369
00:34:18,630 --> 00:34:20,860
<font size="64">"His family and his acquaintances..."</font>

1370
00:34:20,900 --> 00:34:22,400
<font size="64">- That's scary. - "had already accepted..."</font>

1371
00:34:22,400 --> 00:34:23,900
<font size="64">"his spiritual abilities..."</font>

1372
00:34:23,970 --> 00:34:25,670
<font size="64">"and were preparing for the shamanic initiation ritual."</font>

1373
00:34:25,670 --> 00:34:27,340
<font size="64">- Goodness. - I see.</font>

1374
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:28,770
<font size="64">"I was surprised,"</font>

1375
00:34:28,770 --> 00:34:32,040
<font size="64">"but since it wasn't my boyfriend's problem, I didn't think much of it."</font>

1376
00:34:32,180 --> 00:34:33,410
<font size="64">"But a few days later,"</font>

1377
00:34:33,540 --> 00:34:37,150
<font size="64">"my future brother-in-law reached out and asked to meet me privately."</font>

1378
00:34:37,210 --> 00:34:39,580
<font size="64">His spiritual powers must be at their peak.</font>

1379
00:34:37,710 --> 00:34:41,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Immersed)</font>

1380
00:34:39,580 --> 00:34:40,850
<font size="64">- Why did he want to meet her? - Why?</font>

1381
00:34:40,950 --> 00:34:43,090
<font size="64">- The power is at its peak... - Is it okay to meet him?</font>

1382
00:34:41,180 --> 00:34:44,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Interesting)</font>

